msgstr ""
"disk;drive;volume;harddisk;hdd;disc;cdrom;dvd;partition;iso;image;backup;restore;benchmark;raid;luks;encryption;S.M.A.R.T.;smart;دىسكا;قوزغاتقۇچ;قاتتىق "
